OL,3,GNEWSAEasyJet shareholders approve
OL,4,A#5.7bn takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FEasyJet shareholders have approved the
OL,7,Fairline's #5.7bn takeover by private
OL,8,Fequity firm Apollo, paving the way for
OL,9,Fit to fall into US ownership.
OL,11,FThe Luton-based carrier said 97.07% of
OL,12,Fshareholders voted in favour of the
OL,13,Ftakeover by the US investment group at
OL,14,Fa meeting of its investors on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FAccording to the airline the deal will
OL,18,Fbe completed by the end of March next
OL,19,Fyear.
